#. <CLT 4>３階まで一気に、
#. 階段を駆け上がると…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I flew up the stairs leading to the 3rd floor.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>すぐに、廊下で立ち往生している
#. 彼女の姿が目に入った。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Right away, I saw her standing there in the hallway.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. な、苗木…！
msgctxt "0003 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "M-Makoto!"
msgstr ""

#. 朝日奈さん、どうしたの…！？
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Hina, what's wrong!?"
msgstr ""

#. た、大変なの…
msgctxt "0005 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "I-It's awful..."
msgstr ""

#. そこの娯楽室のドアが開いてて…
msgctxt "0006 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "The rec room door was open..."
msgstr ""

#. な、中を覗いたら…
#. 中に…中に…！
msgctxt "0007 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "A-And when I looked inside, I saw...I saw...!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>娯楽室の…中…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>What did you see?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. みんなの事…呼んで来た方がいいよね…？
msgctxt "0009 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "I'd better get the others...right...?"
msgstr ""

#. 私…みんなを集めて来るから…
#. 苗木は先に行ってて…！
msgctxt "0010 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "I...I'm gonna go get 'em! You go on ahead, Makoto!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>彼女は、慌てて階段を駆け下りていった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Before I could say anything, she was rushing\n"
"downstairs.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 娯楽室…？　何があるんだよ…？
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "The rec room...? What did she see in there...?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクは、なかば条件反射のように、
#. 娯楽室へと飛び込んだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>By this point, I was used to acting without thinking.\n"
"So without thinking, I leapt into the rec room.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
